WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.640
That was all that we needed to make a functional web application in Python using Flask.

00:06.640 --> 00:10.240
It calls the GitHub search API under the hood.

00:10.240 --> 00:16.320
It uses Flask and Jinger templating to display our results in HTML.

00:16.320 --> 00:20.320
And there's no JavaScript in this repository.

00:20.320 --> 00:24.320
This is all possible without having to introduce another language.

